{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5052afc3a98cf88cc3c44e071a6f791d781bc6d59f254cfd306d8121cb306141", "ja": "美奈子とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "和美奈子一同外出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca6cc18a6be4b9f65389f99c82e0fce14aaa6d41df2d42ed332db76557c11d36", "ja": "（白川郷で行われるイベントに、美奈子が出演する事に\nなった。歌も披露する予定だけど、はたして……）", "zh": "（美奈子要参加在白川乡举办的活动。她还打算献唱，不过究竟会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "07ef0049050c53c521f39a913cadc3f48ca891a1aa32338ca9e9be7994e99052", "ja": "わっほ～い！　飛騨高山のみなさん、こんにちはー！　\n私、765プロの佐竹美奈子っていいます！", "zh": "哇呼～！飞驒高山的各位，大家好——！  \n我是765PRO的佐竹美奈子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "62f0bb7f1942c23a5cfca169b35f22e0eeb5fbecf863816ba84bbecffcab279c", "ja": "ワーッ！！", "zh": "哇——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "961413c5ddddedfdcf9761c85bc8be91f75a5d8539eb6c52ff551af383f846e6", "ja": "お招きいただき、ありがとうございます！　今日は私、\nアイドルとして歌を披露する予定なんですけど……。", "zh": "感谢您的邀请！今天我作为偶像，打算为大家献上一首歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "a3085107830090a4753762bf82bf2e362a44cd4400cbe2b060ab87af5cc2b7db", "ja": "まずは、白川の民謡を歌わせて頂きたいと思います！\nよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "首先，我想为大家演唱白川的民谣！\n请多多关照——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "deacea5062ba2cae2fae27f4286fdb155f32f41d5ee23d14f2487d9caa888df5", "ja": "ワァアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "519bab933336ea40b3ffe007d6ecd79aa44f59321c607ea806d98d8300b21e77", "ja": "（美奈子のアイディアで、地元の民謡をセットリストに\n取り入れてみたけど……客席の反応、バッチリだな！）", "zh": "（按照美奈子的想法，把当地民谣加入了演出歌单，不过……观众席的反应相当不错啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "a2c1e5cb3ec5883249df28b1947d35f448c073ca0dcd449716e9b69ac2775602", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでした！\nステージ、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦！\n舞台表现，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8240710175a8197fc918f0f9e50ba59e4d1a9e848d22545920a5cb5aab288b83", "ja": "バッチリだったよ！　それにしても美奈子、\n白川の民謡なんてよく知ってたな。", "zh": "非常顺利！话说回来，美奈子，你居然知道白川的民谣啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "ef75dd832a5a6ce61a29b4d4ae442353725ac8f75f097520e25873c03bc1769f", "ja": "私のお父さん、民謡が好きでよく歌ってるんです。\n白川郷でイベントに出るって言ったら、教えてくれて。", "zh": "我爸爸很喜欢民谣，经常唱给我听。听说要去白川乡参加活动后，他就教了我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "11d1ae9872e0b196f9ce5f4efa546891e3debbd7db30585f8a0d44ee588077ea", "ja": "お客さんが一緒に歌ってくれて、うれしかったなぁ……\n帰ったら、お父さんにも報告しなくちゃ。えへへ♪", "zh": "观众愿意一起唱，我真的好开心啊……\n回去以后，也得向爸爸报告一下才行。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_019min01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_019min01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9fdf634727b5422c72b448ff753abe33a1253472c74ee3af3631d014b170d5de", "ja": "（皆、心から楽しそうだった。美奈子の、地元の人達に\n喜んで欲しいという気持ちが伝わった証拠だな！）", "zh": "（大家看起来都发自内心地玩得很开心。看来，这就是美奈子想让当地人开心的心意传达给大家的证明啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
